    <item>
      <title>闲聊  我花近 5000 元，用 Claude、Codex、DeepSeek 搭了一套 A 股价格行为选股系统</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/stock002/post/20260816/%E9%97%B2%E8%81%8A-%E6%88%91%E8%8A%B1%E8%BF%91-5000-%E5%85%83%E7%94%A8-ClaudeCodexDeepSeek-%E6%90%AD%E4%BA%86%E4%B8%80%E5%A5%97-A-%E8%82%A1%E4%BB%B7%E6%A0%BC%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E9%80%89%E8%82%A1%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F/</link>
